Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've succumbed to temptation yet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, wait-!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,The dog? A-and you look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you shouldn't eat fries on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,GIMME BACK MY FRIES!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:35.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,THOSE FRIES ARE MINE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quit slippin' through all these tight spaces!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Give me back my fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone, ya greasy elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the one who swiped\Nmy precious fries in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:00:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,A puppy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.63,0:01:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You stole my fries 'cause you were\Ntrying to get food for the puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika's a pack leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's gotta look out for her kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,This one needs lots of food!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:13.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,439.2)}{\an7}Groooowl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she lose weight 'cause\Nshe was feeding it her food?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about Laika. She's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eat your fill, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks. Why the change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno... I just felt like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,No particular reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's it saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.33,0:01:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,"I can't eat this. It's got too much salt."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's more health-conscious than we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go buy some dog food...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:58.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:56.46,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,604.8)}{\an7}The Affectionate Dog and the Dark Roast Plant
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well that was a disaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm missing out on delicious fries...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:03:02.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,165.6)}{\an7}Today's Special\N{\pos(243.2,216)}{\an7}German Kaffee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:03:02.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,"German"... Not sure how to read\Nthat second word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure Germans eat potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, a special means it's a good bargain...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The average person might not care,\Nbut you can't fool a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:15.92,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,108)}{\an7}The Original\N{\pos(166.4,158.4)}{\an7}Café Siren
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll get to eat some fries after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Café Siren!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's your German coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,German... coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right, German coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can add milk and sugar to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Coffee...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what the human\Nalways drinks in the mornings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.83,0:03:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think he said it's a type of liquid\Nextracted from beans...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can they make it from potatoes, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a really dark color, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,it does smell nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:47.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not food, but if it's made of potatoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Café Siren!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:54.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello. I'm here to pick up\Nsome coffee beans I ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course! Give me just one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:03:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence. Hey, Elfuda-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The hell kind of a special is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll stick to potatoes, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:14.46,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,One disaster after the next...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't think today\Ncould get any worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:25.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a rose bush Kusahanada gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not doing so well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,See for yerself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You look the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fish are tasty this season...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you want to lose weight,\NI hear pork is a good option.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pork?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oink...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh my! Hello there, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:48.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's starting to wilt, and it's got\Nwhite spots on its leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goodness, the poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:54.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I take a closer look?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, by all means! Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, what's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:07.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alraune can use magic to\Ncommand plants at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:11.42,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,446.4)}{\an7}Sour Spud      Sweet Spud
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Move 'em, change 'em...\Nand heal 'em, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a delicate skill unique to creatures\Nthat share an even deeper connection
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,to nature than us elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even the leaves look good as new!\NThat's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:31.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was quite a yawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Overdid it on the magic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's no good...\NI'm still on the job...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I wore you out...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That reminds me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:43.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, I'd planned on giving these to you\Nas my way of saying thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:45.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Coffee beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, those look high quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! The rest of you\Nmight as well try some, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, I could go for some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That crap is poison to us otherwordly beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Coffee is coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll like it better if you\Nadd plenty of milk and sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I fetch some boiling water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else we'll need?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nope, I've got it covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I brought all the essentials with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are part of your present!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You... really thought of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's just the kind of person he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,So Kusahanada, is this your\Nfirst time drinking coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've had it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I don't remember how I felt about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:38.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mmm, it smells lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll say!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ain't nothin' on the shore quite like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And what a pretty color.\NLike the finest mulch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mulch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Must be a plant thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, time for a taste test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It has a fruity and refreshing\Nacidity on the palate,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,along with a slightly sweet finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Less bitter than sea snails, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It'd pair well with a pastry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,So yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Different beans have different flavors.\NIt gets pretty in-depth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And, in addition to fighting off drowsiness,\Ncaffeine helps burn fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'see, caffeine stimulates the sympathetic\Nnervous system, triggering adrenaline and-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:27.71,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,144)}{\an7}Ooooohhh
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The heck is goin' on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alraune absorb moisture and nutrients...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,the properties of which affect the flowers\Non their heads and their personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,So the coffee is the culprit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, totes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, why would you even ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't even!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is she talking like that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,OMG, I feel fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,These vibes are fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,A valley girl...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.67,0:08:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, will she go back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Probably... I'd imagine it's a temporary thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look at all my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Da-da-da-dun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's give 'em a great big hug!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw, I don't get why you're so salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to gas up my besties!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.13,0:08:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're low-key giving me the ick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:27.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think you need to cool off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lit AF!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:32.67,Q8,,0,0,0,,That was hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does she look stronger to anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd you give WATER to the PLANT LADY?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:41.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,Oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's almost like she's drunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-are you alright?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,HUMAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,you're way more adorbs up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why, I could just... eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:08:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-H-HELP! SHE'S GONNA EAT ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on, we're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's high time we saved you for once, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oink-!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I swear I don't taste good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm, fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,A little too piggish, IMO.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'm really not even that cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Relax, orc!\NShe didn't mean it as a compliment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now feel the wrath of the mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She got me hook, line, and sinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got this. Buy me some time\Nto charge up my magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with that pesky ivy of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I forgot to bring my arrows...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Silly little elf, you're such a ditz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tee-hee, mlem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Arrows or no arrows, I can make this work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,CHAAAAARGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,ELFUDAAAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oink... oink...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm all washed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you guys alright?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then...\Nit would seem we're alone at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Boy, am I starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Down the hatch you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I let my guard down...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.71,0:10:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what about the human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:33.96,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,79.2)}{\an7}Boo-hoo-hoo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Boo-hoo-hoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sniffle, sniffle, sob...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:36.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wahh, sob, sob, sniffle...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Boo-hoo-hoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:45.08,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,86.4)}{\an7}The Alraune's Garden
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Safe and sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,...except for his pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:51.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,223.2)}{\an7}Alternate Dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:51.96,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,403.2)}{\an7}Keep Out
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:51.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,547.2)}{\an7}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:11:00.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So this is where she went...
